## Optionally add Omni-Path support services on *head node*

{% if is_ubuntu -%}
Ubuntu 24.04 does not currently provide the Omni-Path package set used by the
upstream EL and openEuler recipes. Sites that require Omni-Path should add a
vendor-supported Ubuntu package repository before enabling this optional path.
{% else -%}
The following command adds Omni-Path support using base distro-provided drivers
to the chosen *head node*.

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Optionally add Omni-Path support services on head node -->
<!-- ohpc_if_set enable_opa -->
```bash
{{ pkg_install }} opa-basic-tools
```
<!-- ohpc_fi -->
<!-- ohpc_end -->

